<title>USA: Network Imaging CEO adds chairman title.</title>
<headline>Network Imaging CEO adds chairman title.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network Imaging Corp said on Wednesday that James Leto, president and chief executive officer, was elected chairman of the board at the company's annual shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>He will continue to serve as president and chief executive officer, Network Imaging said.</p>
<p>Leto replaces Robert Bernardi as chairman of the board, the company said. Bernardi will continue as a board member.</p>
</text>
